parents' permission.

30
00:02:02,180 --> 00:02:03,571
At precisely nine o'clock,

31
00:02:03,571 --> 00:02:05,871
Robert quickly pulled
on a light jacket and

32
00:02:05,871 --> 00:02:08,385
