34
00:02:10,220 --> 00:02:13,870
He said: "Mom, please
wait a few minutes for me.

35
00:02:14,710 --> 00:02:17,537
The man doing maintenance
work on the shelves inside the

36
00:02:17,537 --> 00:02:20,717
