38
00:02:22,770 --> 00:02:25,800
[HOST] A wage of five dollars
an hour in 1978 was more than

39
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:28,830
double the minimum wage for
a teenager at that time.

40
00:02:29,570 --> 00:02:34,100
Robert eagerly turned back into the
pharmacy to meet the unfamiliar contractor.

41
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:36,353
He had no idea that this was the very last

42
00:02:36,353 --> 00:02:38,510
