47
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:55,170
[RESIDENT] That night, our pharmacy was
having some display shelves renovated.

48
00:02:56,130 --> 00:03:02,130
The building contractor
named John Gacy was standing

49
00:03:03,486 --> 00:03:09,486
