79
00:04:35,530 --> 00:04:38,850
Gacy’s trousers were
caked in fresh, damp mud.

80
00:04:39,310 --> 00:04:42,541
And from his body emanated
an exceedingly bizarre,

81
00:04:42,541 --> 00:04:45,191
foul odor so repulsive that investigators

82
00:04:45,191 --> 00:04:47,970
across the desk could
