83
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:51,097
[PSYCHOLOGIST] In criminal psychology,

84
00:04:51,097 --> 00:04:54,327
narcissistic psychopaths
like John Wayne Gacy often

85
00:04:54,327 --> 00:04:57,240
