96
00:05:36,140 --> 00:05:39,006
[HOST] The moment John Wayne Gacy
walked out of the police station,

97
00:05:39,006 --> 00:05:41,824
Lieutenant Joseph Kozenczak
ordered an immediate exhaustive

98
00:05:41,824 --> 00:05:44,260
