had been extinguished

231
00:13:25,218 --> 00:13:26,210
in the darkness of a
single serial predator.

232
00:13:27,370 --> 00:13:30,150
[HOST] All of America
was rocked to its core.

233
00:13:30,230 --> 00:13:31,959
The man who wore a clown suit
to bring joy to children,

234
00:13:31,959 --> 00:13:33,971
who stood photographed beside the
First Lady of the White House,

235
00:13:33,971 --> 00:13:35,040
had unveiled his monstrous nature.

236
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:38,073
He was the living embodiment
of the most duplicitous,

237
00:13:38,073 --> 00:13:40,530
lethal two-faced predator
of the twentieth century.

238
00:13:43,790 --> 00:13:45,960
[HOST] Following his formal
arrest and confronted

239
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:47,923
with insurmountable forensic evidence,

240
00:13:47,923 --> 00:13:52,160
John Wayne Gacy understood that his facade
as an upstanding citizen had collapsed.

241
00:13:53,040 --> 00:13:55,270
Yet the psychopath did not break down.

242
00:13:55,450 --> 00:13:58,467
He immediately deployed a
sophisticated defense tactic:

243
00:13:58,467 --> 00:14:01,046
Orchestrating an elaborate
insanity performance

244
00:14:01,046 --> 00:14:03,350
to evade the ultimate sentence of the law.

245
00:14:05,110 --> 00:14:08,705
[INVESTIGATOR] During evaluations with
court-appointed psychiatric experts,

246
00:14:08,705 --> 00:14:12,780
Gacy began describing a bizarre
internal psychological architecture.

247
00:14:13,450 --> 00:14:18,118
He claimed that within his body
existed four distinct personalities:

248
00:14:18,118 --> 00:14:20,315
John the hardworking contractor,

249
00:14:20,315 --> 00:14:23,954
John the patriotic politician,
Pogo the joyful clown,

250
00:14:23,954 --> 00:14:26,700
and a sinister entity named Jack Hanley.

251
00:14:27,330 --> 00:14:29,608
He craftily blamed all homicidal
acts on the Jack Hanley persona,

252
00:14:29,608 --> 00:14:31,220
insisting he was merely
an innocent bystander.

253
00:14:31,350 --> 00:14:32,705
[VIEWER] Gacy was a master
manipulator unlike anyone I

254
00:14:32,705 --> 00:14:34,090
ever encountered in my
entire policing career.

255
00:14:35,510 --> 00:14:37,359
He could be weeping,
displaying apparent agony,

256
00:14:37,359 --> 00:14:39,129
pleading that the Jack
Hanley persona did all

257
00:14:39,129 --> 00:14:40,860
those horrific things
without his knowledge.

258
00:14:41,460 --> 00:14:47,460
Yet the second our eyes turned away, or
whenever someone new entered the room,

259
00:14:49,477 --> 00:14:55,477
his gaze shifted instantly: Cold,
calculated, and razor-sharp.

260
00:14:56,290 --> 00:14:57,791
He remembered the exact
location of every single

261
00:14:57,791 --> 00:14:59,260
burial trench he had ever
dug under that house.

262
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:04,740
That was never the
behavior of an insane man,

263
00:15:04,740 --> 00:15:10,740
but the cold calculation of a
predator seeking to control the game.

264
00:15:13,020 --> 00:15:16,666
[HOST] When the trial opened in February
1980 at the Cook County Courthouse,

265
00:15:16,666 --> 00:15:19,730
the defense team relied entirely
upon an insanity defense.

266
00:15:20,470 --> 00:15:24,087
They argued that their client suffered
from dissociative schizophrenia

267
00:15:24,087 --> 00:15:27,860
originating from severe childhood
abuse inflicted by an alcoholic father.

268
00:15:28,810 --> 00:15:31,034
[PSYCHOLOGIST] Gacy’s
childhood was indeed steeped in

269
00:15:31,034 --> 00:15:33,374
severe physical beatings and humiliation

270
00:15:33,374 --> 00:15:37,470
from an alcoholic father who constantly
degraded his son as a failure.

271
00:15:38,070 --> 00:15:42,576
To survive that profound helplessness,

272
00:15:42,576 --> 00:15:48,576
Gacy erected a gargantuan
narcissistic ego to overcompensate.

273
00:15:49,810 --> 00:15:55,330
He hungered insatiably for power, admiration,
and absolute dominion over others.

274
00:15:55,400 --> 00:15:55,640
However,

275
00:15:55,640 --> 00:15:58,135
the fundamental distinction between genuine
psychosis and narcissistic manipulation

276
00:15:58,135 --> 00:16:00,390
lies in the deliberate intent and
premeditated planning behind the conduct.

277
00:16:00,840 --> 00:16:01,773
[HOST] Before the jury,

278
00:16:01,773 --> 00:16:04,629
Chief Prosecutor William
Kunkle dismantled Gacy’s

279
00:16:04,629 --> 00:16:08,360
multiple-personality charade with
devastating physical evidence.

280
00:16:09,510 --> 00:16:13,359
[INVESTIGATOR] We demonstrated before
the court that prior to his crimes,

281
00:16:13,359 --> 00:16:18,070
Gacy routinely stockpiled bags of
lime to suppress decomposition odors.

282
00:16:18,090 --> 00:16:21,117
He hired young laborers
to dig trenches under his

283
00:16:21,117 --> 00:16:24,145
foundation under the
pretext of drainage repairs,

284
00:16:24,145 --> 00:16:27,110
only to convert those
ditches into their graves.

285
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:29,782
He frequently employed trick handcuffs,

286
00:16:29,782 --> 00:16:34,370
enticing young men to slip them on under
the guise of demonstrating a magic trick.

287
00:16:35,530 --> 00:16:39,340
Then he snapped them shut to render
his victims entirely helpless.

288
00:16:40,780 --> 00:16:43,866
[PSYCHOLOGIST] A truly psychotic
individual experiencing cognitive

289
00:16:43,866 --> 00:16:47,799
disintegration does not excavate
burial trenches days in advance,

290
00:16:47,799 --> 00:16:51,430
nor purchase industrial deodorizers
on a recurring schedule.

291
00:16:51,980 --> 00:16:54,964
Nor do they systematically
preserve specific personal

292
00:16:54,964 --> 00:16:57,610
effects from each victim
as organized trophies.

293
00:16:57,610 --> 00:17:01,478
Every action taken by Gacy
displayed a coherent causal chain,

294
00:17:01,478 --> 00:17:06,360
meticulous preparation, and absolute
post-offense effort to conceal evidence.

295
00:17:07,450 --> 00:17:11,289
[HOST] On March 13th, 1980, after
less than two hours of deliberation,

296
00:17:11,289 --> 00:17:15,980
the jury returned a historic verdict:
Completely rejecting the insanity plea.

297
00:17:16,970 --> 00:17:20,824
John Wayne Gacy was found criminally
responsible for thirty-three

298
00:17:20,824 --> 00:17:24,084
counts of murder and sentenced
to the ultimate penalty:

299
00:17:24,084 --> 00:17:24,440
Death.

300
00:17:26,990 --> 00:17:29,077
[HOST] Throughout fourteen
years on death row at

301
00:17:29,077 --> 00:17:31,063
Menard Correctional Center in Illinois,

302
00:17:31,063 --> 00:17:33,711
John Wayne Gacy never once
expressed genuine remorse

303
00:17:33,711 --> 00:17:36,460
or offered a sincere apology
to the victims' families.

304
00:17:37,540 --> 00:17:42,760
Instead, he continuously exploited media
notoriety to feed his malignant narcissism.

305
00:17:43,360 --> 00:17:46,062
He painted hundreds of
oil portraits depicting

306
00:17:46,062 --> 00:17:48,706
Pogo the Clown with
grotesque pointed smiles,

307
00:17:48,706 --> 00:17:51,350
marketing them for sale
outside prison walls.

308
00:17:52,170 --> 00:17:55,868
In his self-published manifesto
titled They Call Him a Monster,

309
00:17:55,868 --> 00:17:58,510
Gacy audaciously made
a shocking declaration.

310
00:17:59,450 --> 00:18:03,800
He proclaimed: "I am actually the
thirty-fourth victim of this case.

311
00:18:04,300 --> 00:18:06,635
I was merely cleaning up
crime scenes for other

312
00:18:06,635 --> 00:18:08,820
people and got framed
by the justice system.

313
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:13,645
[PSYCHOLOGIST] The assertion of being
the thirty-fourth victim lays bare the

314
00:18:13,645 --> 00:18:16,930
ultimate externalization defense
mechanism of the psychopath.

315
00:18:17,370 --> 00:18:23,370
They possess a complete
deficit in neurological

316
00:18:26,030 --> 00:18:32,030
regions governing empathy
and human compassion.

317
00:18:35,520 --> 00:18:36,551
In Gacy’s distorted worldview,

318
00:18:36,551 --> 00:18:38,511
losing his public reputation,
his contracting enterprise,

319
00:18:38,511 --> 00:18:40,368
and his personal liberty
constituted the true tragedy,

320
00:18:40,368 --> 00:18:42,190
not the extinguishing of
thirty-three innocent lives.

321
00:18:43,400 --> 00:18:45,519
He positioned himself at the
absolute center of the universe,

322
00:18:45,519 --> 00:18:47,430
refusing to confront the
reality of his own atrocities.

323
00:18:47,520 --> 00:18:49,318
[HOST] At midnight on May 10th, 1994,
at Stateville Correctional Center,

324
00:18:49,318 --> 00:18:51,310
the death penalty by lethal injection
was executed upon John Wayne Gacy.

325
00:18:52,280 --> 00:18:54,779
When asked if he wished
to leave any final words,

326
00:18:54,779 --> 00:18:57,380
the killer neither prayed
nor expressed contrition.

327
00:18:57,900 --> 00:19:02,350
He merely sneered and spat out a
bitter, defiant curse: "Kiss my ass.

328
00:19:02,480 --> 00:19:06,510
It was the final defiance of
a dark personality refusing

329
00:19:06,510 --> 00:19:10,180
to yield before justice
until his very last breath.

330
00:19:10,570 --> 00:19:10,862
[HOST] Nearly half a century
has passed since that

331
00:19:10,862 --> 00:19:11,160
fateful winter night
for young Robert Piest.

332
00:19:12,550 --> 00:19:18,550
Yet the John Wayne Gacy file remains
an enduring case study scrutinized

333
00:19:19,803 --> 00:19:25,803
at the FBI Academy and
criminological institutes worldwide.

334
00:19:26,300 --> 00:19:29,126
To protect ourselves and our
loved ones from predators

335
00:19:29,126 --> 00:19:31,481
cloaked in the guise of
respectable citizens,

336
00:19:31,481 --> 00:19:35,040
Amber Eyes presents four critical
Red Flags from this investigation:

337
00:19:35,410 --> 00:19:36,633
The first red flag:

338
00:19:36,633 --> 00:19:41,780
Beware the dazzling glamour of philanthropic
disguises and high social standing.

339
00:19:42,560 --> 00:19:44,803
Charitable endeavors, community titles,

340
00:19:44,803 --> 00:19:48,830
and civic prestige never constitute
absolute proof of moral character.

341
00:19:49,130 --> 00:19:49,703
Frequently,

342
00:19:49,703 --> 00:19:53,143
the shield of philanthropy serves
as the most effective camouflage

343
00:19:53,143 --> 00:19:56,010
erected by malicious actors
to disarm public suspicion.

344
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:57,687
The second red flag:

345
00:19:57,687 --> 00:20:01,850
The lure of abnormally high-paying
employment offers targeting youth.

346
00:20:02,400 --> 00:20:06,530
Predators routinely exploit the innocence
and financial eagerness of teenagers.

347
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:10,124
They present job offers
featuring extraordinary

348
00:20:10,124 --> 00:20:12,988
compensation without requiring experience,

349
00:20:12,988 --> 00:20:17,010
designed to entice vulnerable
victims into isolated spaces.

350
00:20:17,500 --> 00:20:20,760
The third red flag: Magic tricks and
physical games designed to disarm resistance.

351
00:20:21,500 --> 00:20:25,939
Transforming restraining instruments such
as handcuffs or ropes into harmless games

352
00:20:25,939 --> 00:20:30,110
is a classic ploy to coax victims into
voluntarily relinquishing self-defense.

353
00:20:30,650 --> 00:20:34,017
Always maintain safe personal
boundaries and unequivocally reject

354
00:20:34,017 --> 00:20:37,540
any requests for physical restraint
from acquaintances or strangers.

355
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:39,156
The fourth red flag:

356
00:20:39,156 --> 00:20:43,110
Identifying externalized blame
and the total absence of remorse.

357
00:20:43,430 --> 00:20:46,935
An individual who never acknowledges
fault and habitually casts

358
00:20:46,935 --> 00:20:50,830
themselves as the victim in every
conflict presents a profound danger.

359
00:20:51,260 --> 00:20:53,915
Absolute apathy toward
the suffering of others

360
00:20:53,915 --> 00:20:56,570
is the ultimate red flag
of a toxic pathology.

361
00:20:56,670 --> 00:20:58,681
A clown’s mask may elicit laughter,

362
00:20:58,681 --> 00:21:02,530
but genuine safety stems solely
from our vigilance and discernment.

363
00:21:03,110 --> 00:21:06,910
Thank you for joining Amber Eyes
in exploring today’s case file.

364
00:21:07,210 --> 00:21:11,280
Please subscribe to the channel and share
your reflections in the comments below.

365
00:21:11,430 --> 00:21:13,790
Goodbye and see you in
our upcoming episodes.
